// the shipped app is unaffected (nothing in the app references this file, so it
// tree-shakes away).
//
// Both come from the vendors' own distribution, not from a redrawing:
//   Google Play  play.google.com/intl/en_us/badges/static/images/badges/
//                en_badge_web_generic.png  (646x250, its 41px clear space intact)
//   App Store    tools.applemediaservices.com official SVG, rasterised at 720x241
//
// Sized by [kPlayButtonFraction] so the two BUTTONS end up the same height on
// screen: Google ships its badge inside a padded canvas and Apple does not, so
// matching the image heights would leave the Play button visibly smaller.

